WEBVTT

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.254
And she said it's a rather boring movie.

00:03:01.278 --> 00:03:02.279
(Laughter)

00:03:02.303 --> 00:03:04.508
She said, "All these people
with Eastern dress,

00:03:04.532 --> 00:03:08.526
walking up and down,
very repetitive, very limited."

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:09.952
(Laughter)

00:03:09.976 --> 00:03:12.747
And she had a sense of humor.

00:03:12.771 --> 00:03:16.073
She knew it was a hallucination,
but she was frightened.

00:03:16.097 --> 00:03:17.461
She had lived 95 years,

00:03:17.485 --> 00:03:19.762
and she'd never had
a hallucination before.

00:03:20.247 --> 00:03:25.303
She said that the hallucinations were
unrelated to anything she was thinking

00:03:25.327 --> 00:03:27.921
or feeling or doing,

00:03:27.945 --> 00:03:31.712
that they seemed to come on
by themselves, or disappear.